{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfrqBTS9z77e2XkWYjshY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"<REDACTED>","signature":""},{"type":"server_tool_use","id":"srvtoolu_01Mk8xL9xfxJKaXyCAi3hCZk","name":"web_search","input":{"query":"Anthropic Claude Code official documentation overview"}},{"type":"web_search_tool_result","tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Mk8xL9xfxJKaXyCAi3hCZk","content":[{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Claude Code Official Documentation by Anthropic","url":"https://claudelog.com/faqs/claude-code-docs/","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"412 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"GitHub - anthropics/claude-code: Claude Code is an agentic coding tool that lives in your terminal, understands your codebase, and helps you code faster by executing routine tasks, explaining complex code, and handling git workflows - all through natural language commands. · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"6 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Claude Code overview docs: how to navigate, configure, and verify work","url":"https://www.eesel.ai/blog/claude-code-overview-docs","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"30 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"The Claude Code Handbook: A Professional Introduction to Building with AI-Assisted Development","url":"https://www.freecodecamp.org/news/claude-code-handbook/","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"197 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"GitHub - thevibeworks/claude-code-docs: Everything Anthropic ships for builders, archived and updated 4× daily. 3,900+ files. 12 sources. API, Claude Code, MCP, docs, cookbooks, skills, plugins.","url":"https://github.com/thevibeworks/claude-code-docs","encrypted_content":"","page_age":null},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"SDKs, CLI, and libraries - Claude Platform Docs","url":"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/cli-sdks-libraries/overview","encrypted_content":"","page_age":null},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Overview - Claude Code Docs","url":"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/overview","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"86 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Claude Code by Anthropic","url":"https://claude.com/product/claude-code","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"7 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Documentation - Claude Platform Docs","url":"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/home","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"183 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Claude Code","url":"https://aiagentindex.mit.edu/2025/claude-code","encrypted_content":"","page_age":null}],"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"<REDACTED>","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I found the official Claude Code docs. The overview page is at **code.claude.com/docs/en/overview**.\n\n## Where the official docs are\n- Anthropic's Claude Code GitHub repo (updated within the last week) links to "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"code.claude.com/docs/en/overview"},{"type":"text","text":".\n- Older third-party pages still give the earlier address, "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/overview"},{"type":"text","text":". A community project that mirrors the docs says that "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"for official docs, visit code.claude.com and platform.claude.com."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## What the overview page says\n- **What it is:** "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"Claude Code is an agentic coding tool that reads your codebase, edits files, runs commands, and integrates with your development tools. Available in your terminal, IDE, desktop app, and browser."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **What it does:** "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"It helps you build features, fix bugs, and automate development tasks. It understands your entire codebase and can work across multiple files and tools to get things done."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **Where it runs:** "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"The terminal, IDE extensions, a desktop app, and the web."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **Account needed:** "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"Most surfaces require a Claude subscription or Anthropic Console account. The Terminal CLI, VS Code, and JetBrains also support third-party providers."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **Next steps:** It links to guides such as the "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"Quickstart, which walks through your first real task, from exploring a codebase to committing a fix."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## Access and platforms (Anthropic's product page)\n- "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"You can access Claude Code with a Claude Pro or Max plan, a Team or Enterprise plan, or a Claude Console account."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- It's "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"available for macOS, Linux, and Windows."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"Claude Code runs locally in your terminal and talks directly to model APIs without requiring a backend server or remote code index."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## How it compares to Anthropic's other developer tools\nThe Claude Platform docs explain the difference: "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"the CLI, client SDKs, and libraries are for calling the Claude API yourself, where you send each request and handle each response. Claude Code, the Claude Agent SDK, and Claude Managed Agents work at a higher level, providing the agent loop, tool execution, and runtime."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## Third-party guides\n- **eesel.ai:** A guide to finding your way around the docs. It says the overview "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"points to getting started, working in a project, configuring behavior, permissions, integrations, and troubleshooting."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **thevibeworks/claude-code-docs (GitHub):** An "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"auto-updating archive of Anthropic's builder documentation"},{"type":"text","text":". You can "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"clone this repo and point Claude Code at it."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **freeCodeCamp:** A longer tutorial, "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"a complete, professional introduction to Claude Code"},{"type":"text","text":".\n\nSome third-party pages give older links or install steps, so use code.claude.com for the current information."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":13752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":4169,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2901},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":1,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null}